[BEGIN]
  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=AandH XPoint Level Control-AHM64 r0.0\\\\Controls Input to Zone,||1
  Cmn2=and Zone to Zone levels.\\\\Parameters:\\ Input ControlType: Select||1
  Cmn3=Input, Zone or Group.\\ Input ControlChnl: Select valid range from||1
  Cmn4=control type in decimal format.\\ Output ControlType: Select Input,||1
  Cmn5=Zone or Group.\\ Output ControlChnl: Select valid range from control||1
  Cmn6=type in decimal format.\\\\Inputs:\\ Analog-\\  FdrLvl: Set the||1
  Cmn7=analog to the range of 0d~127d (00h~7Fh).\\  		See documentation||1
  Cmn8=for dBu converstion.\\  Inc: Increment Level (1) step with each||1
  Cmn9=pulse.\\  Dec: Decrement Level (1) step with each pulse.\\  		Note:
  Cmn10=||1Increment and Decrement does not ramp, must be done external to||1
  Cmn11=the module.\\	Poll: Pulse to poll and sync the current level. Should||1
  Cmn12=only be needed for initial \\			reading of level at code start or||1
  Cmn13=after recalling a preset. Module will poll\\			internally for other||1
  Cmn14=changes.\\ Serial-\\  FmMixer: Connect to the TCP/IP symbol receive||1
  Cmn15=line.\\\\Outputs:\\ Analog-\\  FdrLvlFb: Feedback of the level in||1
  Cmn16=the range of 0d~127d (00h~7Fh). \\	This is tracked internally by||1
  Cmn17=the module. It is also updated\\	when the mixer sends feedback when||1
  Cmn18=the control is nudged or on a poll.\\  \\ Serial-\\  ToMixer: Connect||1
  Cmn19=to the TCP/IP symbol Transmit line.\\\\Notes:\\ Reference the AHM64||1
  Cmn20=protocol for valid Control Channels for the\\  selected control||1
  Cmn21=type.\\\\ For more information Reference: AHM-TCP-Protocol-V1.pdf\\
  Cmn22=\\ Tested with AHM64 Firmware V1.02 - Rev59154\\\\ Release: 2020-
  Cmn23=Nov-19 Release r0.0\\
[END]
